    Client->>OAuth: User authorizes SkillSwap Arena
    OAuth-->>Client: Redirect to /auth/callback?code=...&state=...
    Client->>Backend: POST /auth/oauth/callback (code, state)
    Backend->>OAuth: Exchange code for Access Token & Profile (email, sub, name)
    Backend->>DB: Find existing user or create linked account
    Backend->>Backend: Issue SkillSwap JWT Session Token
    Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (access_token, user_payload)
    Client-->>User: Navigate to /dashboard
